<reference id="bacnet-BacnetStringIntervalTrendLogExt" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Bacnet String Interval Trend Log Ext (bacnet-BacnetStringIntervalTrendLogExt)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This extension collects a history for the StatusString
out value of a component using a defined interval.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">BacnetStringIntervalTrendLogExt</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">Unlike the equivalent standard history extension (StringIntervalHistoryExt),
you can export the history created by this extension as a fully-compliant
BACnet trend log object.</p><fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">Bacnet String Interval Trend Log Ext properties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" width="700" href="../graphic/bacnetStringIntTrendLogExt_0000095902.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig><p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetDevice</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Trend Logs</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetLogExtensions</uicontrol></menucascade> and double-click
the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetStringIntervalTrendLogExt</uicontrol>.</p><p class="- topic/p ">In addition to the common properties (Status, Fault Cause and Enabled),
